WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,100 --> 00:00:04,700
Xiaohan girl, the door was smashed like this, are you okay?

2
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:10,370
Those people are bullying others. If your door is broken, how can you stay here tonight?

3
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:14,370
Pack your things and go upstairs with Auntie. As long as Auntie has something to eat, you won't be hungry!

4
00:00:14,370 --> 00:00:21,320
Okay, now that I've dealt with those bad guys, it's time to sort out the supplies I collected.

5
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:40,280
The ground near the yard rose the fastest, and ten meters away it rose about half as slowly.

6
00:00:40,280 --> 00:00:43,589
So that circle of heavy grain

7
00:00:43,589 --> 00:00:47,371
It’s just right to have heavy trees in the outer circle

8
00:00:47,371 --> 00:00:50,680
I almost forgot you

9
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:55,520
Put these wild boars into the resting area first, otherwise they will become thinner as they are raised.

10
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:58,320
I have used up too much mental energy today and I can’t do anything anymore.

11
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:00,320
The remaining work will continue tomorrow
